## 🟡 Fix #9 — Duplicate [getDistanceKm](file:///c:/Users/User/Desktop/KitarCash-demo/services/firestoreService.ts#5-16) function (in 3 files)

**Step 1 — Create a shared utility file.**

Create a new file at `c:\Users\User\Desktop\KitarCash-demo\services\geoUtils.ts`:

```typescript
/**
 * Haversine formula: calculates the distance between two lat/lng coordinates in km.
 */
export const getDistanceKm = (lat1: number, lng1: number, lat2: number, lng2: number): number => {
  const R = 6371;
  const dLat = ((lat2 - lat1) * Math.PI) / 180;
  const dLng = ((lng2 - lng1) * Math.PI) / 180;
  const a =
    Math.sin(dLat / 2) * Math.sin(dLat / 2) +
    Math.cos((lat1 * Math.PI) / 180) *
    Math.cos((lat2 * Math.PI) / 180) *
    Math.sin(dLng / 2) * Math.sin(dLng / 2);
  return R * 2 * Math.atan2(Math.sqrt(a), Math.sqrt(1 - a));
};
```

**Step 2 — Update [PickupScheduler.tsx](file:///c:/Users/User/Desktop/KitarCash-demo/components/PickupScheduler.tsx)**

Add this import at the top (after the other imports, around line 6):
```typescript
import { getDistanceKm } from '../services/geoUtils';
```

Then **delete** the entire [getDistanceKm](file:///c:/Users/User/Desktop/KitarCash-demo/services/firestoreService.ts#5-16) function on lines 23–33 (the one starting with `const getDistanceKm = ...`).

**Step 3 — Update [firestoreService.ts](file:///c:/Users/User/Desktop/KitarCash-demo/services/firestoreService.ts)**

Add this import at the top (after line 2):
```typescript
import { getDistanceKm } from './geoUtils';
```

Then **delete** the [getDistanceKm](file:///c:/Users/User/Desktop/KitarCash-demo/services/firestoreService.ts#5-16) function on lines 5–15.

**Step 4 — Update [MapComponent.tsx](file:///c:/Users/User/Desktop/KitarCash-demo/components/MapComponent.tsx)**

Add this import at the top (after line 3):
```typescript
import { getDistanceKm } from '../services/geoUtils';
```

Then **delete** the [getDistance](file:///c:/Users/User/Desktop/KitarCash-demo/components/MapComponent.tsx#20-33) function on lines 23–32, and update the reference on line 84:

Find:
```typescript
        distance: getDistance(userLocation.lat, userLocation.lng, rc.lat, rc.lng)
```
Replace with:
```typescript
        distance: getDistanceKm(userLocation.lat, userLocation.lng, rc.lat, rc.lng)
```

**Why:** One source of truth. If you ever need to fix the formula, you change it in one place.

